    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "四、解答题：本题共2小题，共27分. 解答应写出必要的文字说明、证明过程或演算步骤."
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                89,
                67,
                791,
                84
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "15. 甲、乙两个学校进行体育比赛, 比赛共设三个项目, 每个项目胜方得 10 分, 负方得 0 分, 没有平局. 三个项目比赛结束后, 总得分高的学校获得冠军. 已知甲学校在三个项目中获胜的概率分别为 0.5, 0.4, 0.8, 各项目的比赛结果相互独立."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                87,
                91,
                907,
                162
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(1)求甲学校获得冠军的概率;"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                87,
                174,
                317,
                190
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(2)用 X 表示乙学校的总得分,求 X 的分布列与期望."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                87,
                202,
                480,
                218
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "16. 设函数   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f(x)=\\ln(a-x)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，已知 x=0 是函数   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y=xf(x)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  的极值点."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                90,
                558,
                598,
                575
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(1) 求 a;"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                97,
                592,
                179,
                607
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "（2）设函数   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "g(x)=\\frac{x+f(x)}{xf(x)}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  。证明:   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "g(x)<1"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                99,
                615,
                442,
                648
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_number",
            "content": {
                "page_number_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "试卷第3页，共4页"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                421,
                958,
                574,
                973
            ]
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "补充题：甲、乙两人投篮,每次由其中一人投篮,规则如下:若命中则此人继续投篮,若未命中则换为对方投篮.无论之前投篮情况如何,甲每次投篮的命中率均为0.6,乙每次投篮的命中率均为0.8,由抽签确定第1次投篮的人选,第1次投篮的人是甲、乙的概率各为0.5."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                87,
                656,
                905,
                728
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(1)求第2次投篮的人是乙的概率;"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                87,
                739,
                354,
                756
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(2)求第 i 次投篮的人是甲的概率;"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                87,
                766,
                349,
                783
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(3)已知:若随机变量   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "X_{i}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  服从两点分布,且   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "P(X_{i}=1)=1-P(X_{i}=0)=q_{i}, i=1,2,\\cdots,n"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " , 则   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "E(\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_{i})=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}q_{i}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " . 记前 n 次(即从第 1 次到第 n 次投篮)中甲投篮的次数为 Y, 求   "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "E(Y)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                87,
                794,
                902,
                848
            ]
        },
